        <activityName xml:lang="en">Spare screen, for tablet, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Spare screen, for tablet, at plant
The data set represents the production of tablet spare screen.; UUID: 4633cc7d-9dbf-33a0-9a10-8f30f1ea40c8
The dataset for tablet spare screen is modeled as a separate LCD display with the size of 238 x 183 mm2, equivalent to 140 grams of LCD module and a coated glass.
Location: Data for global average screen for tablet
Technology: The production of tablet screen requires LED technologies as the backlight for typical LCD screens.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4633cc7d-9dbf-33a0-9a10-8f30f1ea40c8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
